@startuml
'https://SubscriptionServicetuml.com/sequence-diagram



autoactivate on
autonumber

title user’s detail given its reader number

actor "Librarian" as User

participant ":UserController" as Ctrl
participant ":UserService" as srv
participant ":UserRepository" as repo

activate User



User -> Ctrl: Request user’s detail given its phonenumber\n(GET/users/{phone number})
Ctrl -> srv: UserData(findByPhonenumber)

srv -> repo: findByPhonenumber

repo --> srv: user’s detail given its phone number
srv --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> User: ok

@enduml